      "id": "https://www.outsideonline.com/adventure-travel/destinations/europe/kamnik-savinja-alps-water-trail-europe-life-list-thru-hike/",
      "url": "https://www.outsideonline.com/adventure-travel/destinations/europe/kamnik-savinja-alps-water-trail-europe-life-list-thru-hike/",
      "title": "🔓 [Outside Online] Europe’s Newest 191-Mile Thru-Hike Features Wilderness Wine Bars and Zero Crowds",
      "content_html": "<img src=\"https://cdn.outsideonline.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/logar-valley.jpg\" style=\"width:100%;max-height:300px;object-fit:cover;\" />\n<img src=\"https://cdn.outsideonline.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/logar-valley.jpg\" style=\"width:100%;max-height:300px;object-fit:cover;\" />\n<img src=\"https://cdn.outsideonline.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/logar-valley.jpg\" style=\"width:100%;max-height:300px;object-fit:cover;\" />\n<img src=\"https://cdn.outsideonline.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/logar-valley.jpg\" style=\"width:100%;max-height:300px;object-fit:cover;\" />\n<figure><img alt=\"Europe’s Newest 191-Mile Thru-Hike Features Wilderness Wine Bars and Zero Crowds\" src=\"https://cdn.outsideonline.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/logar-valley.jpg?width=1200\" /></figure>\n<p>With incredible mountain views, trail towns serving up local delicacies, and easy logistics, Slovenia's Kamnik-Savinja Alps Water Trail should have a place on any globetrotting hiker's life list.</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.outsideonline.com/adventure-travel/destinations/europe/kamnik-savinja-alps-water-trail-europe-life-list-thru-hike/\">Europe’s Newest 191-Mile Thru-Hike Features Wilderness Wine Bars and Zero Crowds</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://www.outsideonline.com\">Outside Online</a>.</p>",
